# NOTE to bad faith readers of this file:
# 
# If you use LLMs, you must use it according to the https://github.com/fluxerapp/fluxer/blob/main/.github/LLM_USAGE_POLICY.md
# which involves NOT generating code but using it in an ADVISORY role in your development process.
# 
# These files exist in our .gitignore such that if people write local instructions to their LLMs for using an LLM
# in such an ADVISORY role that does NOT involve code generation in their development process, they are treated as
# local configuration that should not be pushed up to the remote.
# 
# Please see https://fluxer.com/ai-stance
# 
